. (C) To avoid recontaminating their hands or surrogate prosthetic devices, FOOD EMPLOYEES may use disposable paper towels or similar clean barriers when touching surfaces such as manually operated faucet handles on a HANDWASHING SINK or the handle of a restroom door."}]},{"id":"517246","date":"2024-09-17","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=517246&INSPECTION_NN=517246","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"491743","date":"2024-02-22","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=491743&INSPECTION_NN=491743","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"483944","date":"2023-12-07","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=483944&INSPECTION_NN=483944","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"456646","date":"2023-05-11","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=456646&INSPECTION_NN=456646","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"444705","date":"2023-01-27","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=444705&INSPECTION_NN=444705","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":16,"title":"Food-contact surfaces; cleaned and sanitized","repeat":false,"comment":"4-601.11: (A) EQUIPMENT FOOD-CONTACT SURFACES and UTENSILS shall be clean to sight and touch. \n\nObserved the ice machine interior baffle to have a layer of pink, slimy mold. Discussed with PIC. Inspector showed PIC where mold accumulation is occurring. PIC had staff remove ice from machine and wash, rinse, and sanitize the interior of the unit, including the baffle. Discussed creating a routine cleaning schedule for the interior of the ice machine. COS.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"418839","date":"2022-05-19","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=418839&INSPECTION_NN=418839","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":16,"title":"Food-contact surfaces; cleaned and sanitized","repeat":false,"comment":"4-501.114: Chemical sanitizer for manual or mechanical operation shall meet proper criteria.\n\nOn arrival, the sani bucket used for the prep area of the kitchen is observed less than 100 ppm Quat. Quat should be 200 ppm minimum. Food handling/ prep observed during the inspection. The bucket was remade during the inspection to correct.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"409876","date":"2022-02-22","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=409876&INSPECTION_NN=409876","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"383976","date":"2021-04-20","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=383976&INSPECTION_NN=383976","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"378605","date":"2021-02-03","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=378605&INSPECTION_NN=378605","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"376193","date":"2020-12-16","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=376193&INSPECTION_NN=376193","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"371109","date":"2020-09-16","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=371109&INSPECTION_NN=371109","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"354995","date":"2020-01-28","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=354995&INSPECTION_NN=354995","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"330388","date":"2019-05-02","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":2,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=330388&INSPECTION_NN=330388","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":20,"title":"Proper cooling time and temperature","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"3-501.14","citation_text":"3-501.14 (A)  (P) Cooked TIME/TEMPERATURE CONTROL FOR SAFETY FOOD shall be cooled: (1) Within 2 hours from 57ºC (135ºF) to 21ºC (70°F), (2) Within a total of 6 hours from 57ºC (135ºF) to 5ºC (41°F) or less.\n\nA container in the walk in cooler of chicken salsa was observed with a date from the previous day (5/1) and an internal temperature of 42 degrees. This puts the RTE foods outside of the time/ temperature requirements for cooling. Cooling procedures were reviewed and the container was discarded during the insepction."},{"item":23,"title":"Proper date marking and disposition","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"3-501.17","citation_text":"3-501.17 (A)  (Pf) Refrigerated, READY-TOEAT, TIME/TEMPERATURE CONTROL FOR SAFETY FOOD prepared and held in a FOOD ESTABLISHMENT for more than 24 hours shall be clearly marked to indicate the date or day by which the FOOD shall be consumed on the PREMISES, sold, or discarded at a maximum of 7 days. The day of preparation shall be counted as Day 1.\nCottage cheese in the front reach in cooler was observed opened and without a date mark. Discussion with employee suggested that the container was opened 3 days prior. A date mark was provided to correct."}]},{"id":"321714","date":"2019-01-24","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No violations found","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=321714&INSPECTION_NN=321714","older":false,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"273346","date":"2018-04-23","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Older report form","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=273346&INSPECTION_NN=273346","older":true,"fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":null,"title":"Proper hygienic practices, eating/drinking/smoking (evidence)","repeat":false,"comment":"750-530a Employees shall consume food only in designated dining areas. An employee dining area shall not be so designated if consuming food there may result in contamination of other food, equipment, utensils, or other items needing protection.\n\nObserved a personal can of soda mixed in with foods intended for students in the front walk in cooler. Discussed with the PIC and the can was moved to the area designated for personal foods during the inspection.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"266459","date":"2018-01-23","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Older report form","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=266459&INSPECTION_NN=266459","older":true,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"245091","date":"2017-05-23","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Older report form","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=245091&INSPECTION_NN=245091","older":true,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"235718","date":"2017-01-18","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Older report form","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8271&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=235718&INSPECTION_NN=235718","older":true,"fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"218278","date":"2016-05-11","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Older report form","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLIS